<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;">New message from your portfolio</h2>
<p style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;"><strong>Name:</strong> <%= @name.presence || "—" %></p>
<p style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;"><strong>Email:</strong> <%= @email.presence || "—" %></p>
<p style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;margin-top:16px;"><strong>Message:</strong></p>
<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;white-space:pre-wrap;"><%= @message %></div>
